      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 82",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 82",
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "同样，把圆柱的侧面和全部表面的展开图的面积分别定义为圆柱的侧面积和全面积（图 82）. 于是，得到公式：$S_{\\text{侧}}=2\\pi RH$，$S_{\\text{圆柱}}=2\\pi RH+2\\pi R^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#7"
      ]
    }
  ]
